    "text": "8 hours ago Kate Gosselin is honoring her late dog Meika. \"I have tried to write this a few times over the last few days,\" Gosselin, 51, wrote via TikTok on Tuesday, July 28. \"It feels too final to put it on paper, so to speak. We lost Meika in the middle of the night on Saturday. She went into respiratory failure and they couldn't revive her. I have NEVER in my life been so broken, angry or grief stricken.\" Read full article",
